message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
title: "Parabolic Basic Theory"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Feldman
    given-names: William M.
repository-code: "https://github.com/willmfeldman/parabolic-basic-theory"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the basic theory of the heat operator and of
  semilinear heat equations: comparison for viscosity solutions, parabolic
  Perron existence, regularity of viscosity caloric functions, interior
  Schauder estimates, and the semilinear Cauchy–Dirichlet problem.
